<title>BRAZIL: Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the month ending March 31 compared with the previous month and the corresponding month last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>Month ending  Month ending  Month ending</p>
<p> .	  31/03/97	28/02/97	31/03/96</p>
<p> Bean	725,900	  43,500	 385,600</p>
<p> Meal	582,000	 305,400	 564,300</p>
<p> Oil	  48,900	  38,000	  48,700</p>
</text>
